{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Model/Unpacked/Operations/Fma.html#Float.Model.UnpackedFloat.fma\"><span class=\"name\">Float</span>.<span class=\"name\">Model</span>.<span class=\"name\">UnpackedFloat</span>.<span class=\"name\">fma</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">spec</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Model/Format/Basic.html#Float.Model.Format\">Format</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Model/Unpacked/Basic.html#Float.Model.UnpackedFloat\">UnpackedFloat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Model/Unpacked/Basic.html#Float.Model.UnpackedFloat\">UnpackedFloat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Model/Unpacked/Basic.html#Float.Model.UnpackedFloat\">UnpackedFloat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Model/Unpacked/Basic.html#Float.Model.UnpackedFloat\">UnpackedFloat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Computes the fused multiply-add `x * y + z` of three floating point numbers and rounds the\nresult according to the given specification. The product `x * y` is exact and never rounded\non its own; only the final sum is rounded.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Float/Model/Unpacked/Operations/Fma.html#Float.Model.UnpackedFloat.fma","kind":"def","line":17,"name":"Float.Model.UnpackedFloat.fma","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Init/Data/Float/Model/Unpacked/Operations/Fma.lean#L17-L55"}}],"imports":["Init.Data.Float.Model.Unpacked.Round"],"instances":[],"name":"Init.Data.Float.Model.Unpacked.Operations.Fma"}